{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》爆出超戲劇性一幕！為爭奪與女神阮嘉敏（Mandy）的「甜品飯腳」約會，求愛勇者吳旭東（東東）竟霸總上身，與對手Hepta飛撲喪爭同一張櫈，場面極度混亂！東東更突然神力上身彈起，直接將櫈搶走放到Mandy面前，究竟這霸道舉動能否贏得女神芳心？</p><p>現場直擊吳旭東飛撲搶櫈超混亂</p><p>爭奪戰一觸即發！當Mandy的關鍵詞「暖」一出，與她心意相通的東東及Hepta即時一支箭標向前搶櫈。二人不約而同睇中同一張櫈，更上演飛撲肉搏戰，場面極度混亂。原本被壓在最底的東東，竟不知哪來的神力，突然用力彈起身，更索性將整張櫈擸走，直接放在Mandy面前坐下，再伸出拳頭示意Mandy來個「fist bump」，整個行徑既浪漫又有型，充滿霸道總裁氣息！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_10178849736abdcf0fc80f7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_21163273266abdcf1363b8c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>Mandy甜笑認冧阿Bob都讚有型</p><p>東東這記石破天驚的「霸總式示愛」，瞬間點燃全場氣氛，所有女神及花生團成員陷入瘋狂尖叫狀態，阿Ju更忍不住直言「Respect」！而被東東突襲的Mandy，全程更是笑到合不攏嘴，事後她坦言覺得東東非常Man：「其實都幾有型嘅嗰吓，好 Man 咯。」就連向來要求高的主持阿Bob，也對東東表示欽佩，宣布他成為候選人時，忍不住大讚：「真係有型到哩！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_10783794146abdcf00c0f9b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_1447799846abdcf06a5ddc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>網民睇到嘩嘩聲大讚夠Man</p><p>節目播出後，東東的霸氣舉動隨即引發網民熱議，討論區被瘋狂洗版！大部分網民都對東東的行為表示欣賞，認為夠直接。「睇到呢幕真係嚇親，但又覺得好Man！」、「呢啲先叫追女仔，夠晒霸氣！」、「Mandy個樣甜到漏，肯定冧死！」不過也有網民認為太誇張：「雖然好有戲劇效果，但現實咁做會嚇親女仔。」、「好似拍緊韓劇咁，太唔真實啦！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_18441416806abdceeb74339.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_7537701576abdceefebabb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_9216016366abdcef417192.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_10600859216abdcef83254e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_6712784686abdcefcb2d77.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_14631613656abdcf0c76b9d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_20933027296abdcf176e405.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_14093719156abdcf1b1e7ee.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_17971515696abdcf1e66119.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_10230035986abdcf21f0bc6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_18547329436abdcf25aa22f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_10037337286abdcf2971007.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_10227426396abdcf2dbc8a7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_12641782446abdcf314c1a6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_5799340716abdcf352d0a6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_3185943856abdcf38806c3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_16456854336abdcf3b8a1ea.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_3226501926abdcf3e9bb1f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_11707273866abdcf41ed598.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_15423211496abdcf4621796.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_2109558386abdcf4ab31e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_9818303316abdcf4e9a8fe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_4186465796abdcf5224984.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_14973025866abdcf58040e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_21352515256abdcf606d905.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_2424409206abdcf67de045.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33a_11293743346abdcf6d8efa0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_9306496416abdcf715cba8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_20776305546abdcf75077de.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_8955535086abdcf782bcb2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_19357492516abdcf7bf0bbd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_15439918996abdcf7eb8015.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T01:39:57.390126+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":980,"images":36,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}